VALUES ('Hajj', 'UB 001', 'Intercontinental / Fairmont — 13-Day (Madinah First)', '13 Days', 'Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental / Fairmont Clock Tower (Makkah) · Dar Al Taqwa (Madinah)', 'Intercontinental / Fairmont', '7 May – 19 May 2027', 'SAR', 0, 0, 59500, '{"tiers":[{"key":"A","label":"Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental"},{"key":"B","label":"Fairmont Clock Tower"}],"rooms":[{"room":"Quad","A":null,"B":59500},{"room":"Triple","A":82000,"B":66000},{"room":"Double","A":98000,"B":76000}]}'::jsonb, 'Non-Aziziya', NULL, 'A 13 Days Executive Platinum Hajj (Madinah-first) with non-shifting stays in Makkah and Madinah (Makkah room retained during the days of Hajj). Choose between Package A (Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental) and Package B (Fairmont Clock Tower). Premium Maktab A-Category services in Mina Zone 1 near Jamarat, an air-conditioned camp in Arafat, private luxury Mashaer buses and the Makkah–Madinah high-speed train are all included.', ARRAY['Non-shifting stay near the Haram', 'Maktab A · Zone 1 Mina', 'A/C Arafat marquee', 'Train Makkah–Madinah', 'Half-board hotel meals', 'Madinah Ziyarat'], '[{"day":"1","stage":"In Madinah","date":"7 May","hijri":"1 Zil Hajj","stay":"Arrive Madinah — Dar Al Taqwa (5★)"},{"day":"2","stage":"In Madinah","date":"8 May","hijri":"2 Zil Hajj","stay":"Dar Al Taqwa (5★)"},{"day":"3","stage":"In Madinah","date":"9 May","hijri":"3 Zil Hajj","stay":"Dar Al Taqwa (5★)"},{"day":"4","stage":"In Makkah","date":"10 May","hijri":"4 Zil Hajj","stay":"Arrive Makkah — Option A: Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental (5★) · Option B: Fairmont Clock Tower (5★)"},{"day":"5","stage":"In Makkah","date":"11 May","hijri":"5 Zil Hajj","stay":"Option A: Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental (5★) · Option B: Fairmont Clock Tower (5★)"},{"day":"6","stage":"In Makkah","date":"12 May","hijri":"6 Zil Hajj","stay":"Option A: Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental (5★) · Option B: Fairmont Clock Tower (5★)"},{"day":"7","stage":"In Makkah","date":"13 May","hijri":"7 Zil Hajj","stay":"Option A: Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental (5★) · Option B: Fairmont Clock Tower (5★)"},{"day":"8","stage":"Days of Hajj","date":"14 May","hijri":"8 Zil Hajj","stay":"Mina (Tarwiyah) — Maktab A tent, Zone 1 near Jamarat"},{"day":"9","stage":"Days of Hajj","date":"15 May","hijri":"9 Zil Hajj","stay":"Arafat (Wuquf) — air-conditioned marquee, then night in Muzdalifah"},{"day":"10","stage":"Days of Hajj","date":"16 May","hijri":"10 Zil Hajj","stay":"Mina (Eid · Rami · Qurbani) — Maktab A tent, Zone 1 near Jamarat"},{"day":"11","stage":"Days of Hajj","date":"17 May","hijri":"11 Zil Hajj","stay":"Mina (Rami) — Maktab A tent, Zone 1 near Jamarat"},{"day":"12","stage":"Return to Makkah","date":"18 May","hijri":"12 Zil Hajj","stay":"Arrive Makkah — Option A: Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental (5★) · Option B: Fairmont Clock Tower (5★)"},{"day":"13","stage":"Departure","date":"19 May","hijri":"13 Zil Hajj","stay":"Departure to airport"}]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Meet & assist at the airport (Jeddah / Madinah Hajj Terminal) — subject to approval handling', 'Group airport transfer by bus to hotel (by Naqaba / Saudi Moallim)', 'Makkah hotel accommodation with breakfast & dinner (Saudi Stars standard)', 'Madinah hotel accommodation with breakfast & dinner (Saudi Stars standard); one night may be reduced per final itinerary', 'Full-board buffet meals in Mina (8–12 Zil Hajj)', '5 days Platinum arrangement (8–12 Zil Hajj) with room retained in Makkah (without meals)', 'Maktab A-Category tent in Mina, Zone 1 very near Jamarat (avg 16 per tent, sofa-cum-bed 50–55 cm, private toilet — Indian & western)', 'Mashaer-day services: pillow, bed sheet, blanket, air-conditioned tent, buffet meals & hot/cold drinks', 'Air-conditioned tent in Arafat with meals & hot/cold drinks; floor mat & snack box in Muzdalifah', 'Private special luxury buses (2025 model) with bathroom — Mina · Arafat · Muzdalifah · Mina', 'Makkah ↔ Madinah transfer by bullet train', 'Mic & speaker for religious guidance in Mina & Arafat', 'Ziyarat in Madinah with guidance', 'Hajj training program & guidance in Pakistan / Saudi Arabia', 'Religious guide book', 'Assistance with Qurbani & Tawaf-e-Ziyarah'], ARRAY['Airline ticket (approx PKR 335,000 from Karachi / PKR 345,000 from North Pakistan; fares from other countries vary)', 'Qurbani (approx SAR 750 per person)', 'Personal expenses & anything not listed under inclusions', 'Optional upgrades & supplements (listed separately below)'], ARRAY['Upgrade from Platinum to Deluxe Family Tent — private deluxe family tent with attached bathroom (on request)', '5-person or 8-person sharing tent with attached bathroom in Mina (on request)', 'Aziziya family rooms for the 5 days of Hajj (+ SAR 20,000)', 'Additional Madinah nights — Double SAR 3,000 / Triple SAR 2,200 / Quad SAR 2,190 per night per person', 'VIP GMC transport for the 5 days of Hajj (SAR 35,000 per vehicle, up to 6 persons; Urdu / English-speaking driver)', 'Upgrade international flight to Business class (subject to availability)', 'Family / private car — Jeddah airport to Makkah hotel & back (SAR 600 per person)', 'Family / private car — Madinah airport to Madinah hotel & back (SAR 150 per person)'], ARRAY['Makkah hotel rooms are retained from 8 to 12 Zil Hajj.', 'Ticket & Qurbani are not included.', 'The number of days in Makkah may be reduced; the package price stays the same.', 'During peak days (1–14 Zil Hajj) hotel check-in is after Isha prayers and check-out is at 12 PM.', 'Book early — prices and packages are subject to change (currency difference), including after booking / Saudi Talimaat changes.'], '{}', 'active', false);

